            "hsla": "hsla(331.17,95.25%,87.82%,0.830)",
            "description": "The Baluchi or Baloch (Baluch) people (including the Marri) and the Brahui (Dravidian speaking Sunnite Muslims) are predominantly Sunni Muslim, seminomadic pastoralists, whose homelands straddle the Iran-Pakistan border as well as including a small portion of southern Afghanistan.",
