            "hsla": "hsla(79.69,95.38%,85.65%,0.810)",
            "description": "Croats are Slavs living primarily in Croatia, although some Croats also live in Bosnia and Herzegovina, Serbia, and Slovenia. Croats are primarily Roman Catholic. Most Croats live in rural areas. The economy is mixed, depending on farming (mostly small farms), service industries, and industry (particularly shipbuilding, textiles and food-processing).",
