            "hsla": "hsla(331.35,95.24%,83.89%,0.780)",
            "description": "The term &#x22;Ghorbat&#x22; is applied to several non-food-producing, itinerant populations of fairly low status throughout the Middle East and parts of Central Asia and the Balkans. In the 1970s the Ghorbat lived scattered throughout the major part of Afghanistan. In the 1980s the location of the Ghorbat within Afghanistan was not known, but some families were reported to have been seen in Pakistan.",
