        {
            "id": "ef05",
            "hsla": "hsla(79.69,95.38%,84.95%,0.800)",
            "description": "The Montenegrins are closely related to the Serbs. Montenegrins speak the Stokavian dialect of Serbo-Croatian and call their republic Crna Gora, meaning &#x22;Black Mountain.&#x22; Where agriculture is possible, farming is of major importance; herding with seasonal movement of animals is important elsewhere. Industry is not that developed. In contrast to the Serbs, clan and tribal groups were of major importance.",
