            "hsla": "hsla(355.21,95.27%,81.95%,0.820)",
            "description": "The Mundurucu live in the Brazilian states of Par&aacute; and Amazonas. There are two groups of Mundurucu, who live in the basins of two major tributaries of the Amazon, the Tapaj&oacute;s and Madeira rivers. This collection deals primarily with the R\u00edo Tapaj&oacute;s group. Mundurucu subsistence focuses on agriculture supplemented with hunting and fishing.",
