            "term": "Semai"
        },
        {
            "id": "an07",
            "hsla": "hsla(331.55,95.30%,83.89%,0.780)",
            "description": "The Semang are a group of nomadic people who live in temporary camps scattered in the forests of Malaysia, Indonesia and Southern Thailand. They live mostly by hunting animals and gathering wild foods and trading forest products for cultivated foods and manufactured goods.",
