            "id": "rn05",
            "hsla": "hsla(331.35,95.30%,84.95%,0.800)",
            "description": "Uzbeks are the largest ethnic group in Uzbekistan. They are Sunni Muslims and they speak a Turkic language. Most Uzbeks grow some, if not most of their food and petty trading is a common activity. Uzbekistan is slowly emerging from the socialist economic system.",
